  "title": {
    "zh": "压强",
    "en": "Pressure"
  },
  "desc": {
    "zh": "穿雪鞋不陷、图钉尖头易摁——同样的力，作用面积越小，压得越狠。「每单位面积上的压力」就是压强。",
    "en": "Snowshoes keep you on top; a thumbtack tip goes in easily. The same force pressed on a smaller area pushes harder: force per unit area is pressure."
  },
